{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 28, :comments ["Então Eu castigarei — a partir de ״ייסר איש את בנו״, diz-se ויסרתי. E igualmente ויסרו אותו. Assim também, da raiz ישב, diz-se ״וישבו בך טירותם״ — em Ezequiel."], :book "leviticus", :voice :rashbam, :lang :pt, :chapter 26, :timestamp "2026-07-30T21:14:00.058351247Z", :translated-from :en, :model "glm-5.2"}